./README.md:1:# Northstar Websites WordPress Theme
./README.md:3:Northstar Websites is a modern service-business WordPress theme for website design, build, support, work examples, resources, contact forms, and newsletter signup.
./README.md:9:Activate the theme in WordPress, create Home, About, Services, Work, Blog, Contact, Privacy Policy, and Terms pages, assign the matching templates, set Home as the static front page, configure Primary and Footer menus, and add a custom logo if desired.
./README.md:17:The theme includes desktop menu panels with rail hover/focus behavior, a mobile drawer with accordions, portfolio filtering, FAQ accordions, contact and service inquiry forms, private admin submission storage, newsletter subscriber management, responsive footer widgets, and policy-page routing.
./README.md:29:The theme manages newsletter subscribers but does not send bulk marketing campaigns. Policy pages render WordPress-managed content and do not provide legal text.
