Implemented a single-pass update inside the prepared theme directory.

What changed:
- Expanded the front-end inquiry form to capture `Company / Organization`, and for service inquiries added `Project type` and `Budget range`.
- Reworked the private `Forms` admin screen to support:
  - viewing all submissions
  - filtering by form type
  - exporting the selected form
  - exporting all submissions
- Extended stored submission metadata and CSV export columns to include company, project type, and budget.
- Updated visible branding copy from `Northstar Websites` to `Northstar Codeworks` in the logo and footer copyright line.

